WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.537
Danny: Where are we?

2
00:00:02.538 --> 00:00:07.274
Brad: There’s some sort of a cord here.

3
00:00:07.275 --> 00:00:10.865
Tina: That’s strange. We’re in a closet.

4
00:00:10.866 --> 00:00:20.264
Danny: I think I know where we are . . .

5
00:00:20.265 --> 00:00:22.430
We’re back at school. Brad:

6
00:00:22.432 --> 00:00:25.097
And recess seems to be over. Tina:

7
00:00:25.098 --> 00:00:31.504
Maybe this has all been a dream.

8
00:00:31.505 --> 00:00:37.789
Brad: Nope. It wasn’t a dream.

9
00:00:37.790 --> 00:00:40.972
Tina: Bello, no!

10
00:00:40.973 --> 00:00:43.313
Danny: We’ve got to stop him.

11
00:00:43.314 --> 00:00:46.419
Brad: Forget that! We’ve got to hide him.

12
00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:50.665
Danny: Right! Where is everybody?

13
00:00:50.666 --> 00:00:57.550
Brad: They’re in class, lucky for us.

14
00:00:57.551 --> 00:01:00.186
Tina: How are we going to catch him?

15
00:01:00.187 --> 00:01:04.285
Danny: We’ve got to slow him down first.

16
00:01:04.286 --> 00:01:07.797
Brad: How do you slow down a runaway giant?

17
00:01:07.798 --> 00:01:10.101
Tina: I’ve got an idea!

18
00:01:10.102 --> 00:01:13.199
Danny: Well, let’s see it.

19
00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:19.581
Tina: Bello, stop!

20
00:01:19.582 --> 00:01:22.147
Bello: Stop.

21
00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:23.859
Danny: He listened to you!

22
00:01:23.860 --> 00:01:26.085
Tina: I know how to talk to

23
00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:29.850
babies. I have to babysit my little brother all the time.

24
00:01:29.851 --> 00:01:32.884
Brad: Well, that was easy.

25
00:01:32.885 --> 00:01:35.531
Tina: Bello, come here.

26
00:01:35.532 --> 00:01:38.328
Bello: Come.

27
00:01:38.329 --> 00:01:43.407
Danny: Wow! A giant who obeys your every command!

28
00:01:43.408 --> 00:01:47.634
Tina: Walk with me, Bello. It’s okay.

29
00:01:47.635 --> 00:01:50.876
Gently, Bello, gently.

30
00:01:50.877 --> 00:01:53.083
Bello: Gentle.

31
00:01:53.084 --> 00:01:56.060
Brad: Okay. Now we can go hide him.

32
00:01:56.061 --> 00:01:58.676
Tina: We need an empty room.

33
00:01:58.677 --> 00:02:00.302
Danny: The art room!

34
00:02:00.303 --> 00:02:02.606
No one will be in it now!

35
00:02:02.608 --> 00:02:05.253
Brad: That’s right.

36
00:02:05.254 --> 00:02:07.702
Danny: Wait! I hear footsteps.

37
00:02:07.703 --> 00:02:14.493
There’s somebody coming down the hall.

38
00:02:14.494 --> 00:02:17.348
Tina: Run, Bello,

39
00:02:17.349 --> 00:02:19.607
run! Brad: We can’t get caught

40
00:02:19.608 --> 00:02:31.693
now! Danny: We’d never get back to Ginormous if we

41
00:02:31.694 --> 00:02:33.888
did! I think he’s gone.

42
00:02:33.889 --> 00:02:35.772
Tina: That was close.

43
00:02:35.773 --> 00:02:41.837
Brad: Yeah. If we get caught, we'll have to wash blackboards for a year.

44
00:02:41.838 --> 00:02:46.103
Bello: Boo!

